'''Queen's Condemnation''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] and appears on the 1st, 2nd, 15th, and 16th days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Honey Trap (Deadly)|Queen's Coronation]]. The first stage yields 1,000,000 XP when first cleared, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Little Leaguer Cat]], Golfer Cat.

